NVIDIA Corporation (NVDA)
FY2026 Special Supplement: Data Center & AI Infrastructure Performance
Ticker Symbol: NVDA (NASDAQ) Fiscal Year: FY2026 Q2 Supplement
Document Type: SEC Form 10-K Excerpt Reporting
Currency: USD ($ Millions)
1. Executive Financial Summary
During fiscal year 2026, NVIDIA Corporation experienced unprecedented growth in its Compute & Networking
segment, driven primarily by enterprise adoption of Blackwell architecture processors and expanded cloud
provider deployments. Total net sales reached record highs, with Data Center operations accounting for 87%
of total consolidated revenue. 
Key Milestone: Data Center quarterly revenue exceeded $34,800 million in Q2 FY2026, representing a 112% year-
over-year growth compared to Q2 FY2025. 
